---
title: Sequence Diagram - Translating selected text from the Chrome extension
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant P as Web page (Chrome tab)
    participant BG as background.js<br/>(service worker)
    participant SP as Side panel<br/>(sidepanel.js + api.js)
    box Payara Micro 7 (embedded container)
        participant SEC as Jakarta Security<br/>Basic auth mechanism
        participant IS as TranslatorIdentityStore
        participant R as TranslatorResource
        participant G as GeminiTranslationService
    end
    participant GEM as Google Gemini API

    U->>P: select text, right-click
    U->>BG: "Translate ... to Darija" (context menu)
    BG->>SP: chrome.sidePanel.open()
    BG->>P: scripting.executeScript(getSelection)
    P-->>BG: exact selected text
    BG->>SP: storage.session.set(pendingSelection)
    SP->>SP: paste text into the text box
    SP->>SEC: POST /darija/api/translator/translate<br/>Authorization: Basic YWxpOmRhcmlqYTIwMjY=<br/>{"text": "...", "script": "arabic"}
    SEC->>IS: validate(UsernamePasswordCredential)

    alt valid credentials
        IS-->>SEC: VALID, groups = {translator-user}
        SEC->>R: translate(TranslationRequest)
        R->>R: validate text (not blank, at most 5000 chars)
        R->>G: translate(text, ARABIC)
        G->>GEM: POST /v1beta/models/gemini-3.8-flash:generateContent<br/>x-goog-api-key, system prompt + JSON schema
        GEM-->>G: {"candidates":[{"content":{"parts":[{"text":"{detectedLanguage, translation}"}]}}]}
        G->>G: GeminiResponseParser.parse()
        G-->>R: TranslationResult
        R-->>SP: 200 OK {sourceText, detectedLanguage, translation, script, model, durationMs}
        SP-->>U: show Darija (right-to-left), Copy button
    else wrong / missing credentials
        IS-->>SEC: INVALID
        SEC-->>SP: 401 Unauthorized<br/>WWW-Authenticate: Basic realm="darija-translator"
        SP-->>U: "Wrong username or password"
    end
